WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.924 --> 00:00:04.627
It was Ben's first day of school at Monster Academy.

2
00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:38.702
He floated into the auditorium for the first-day assembly.

3
00:00:46.066 --> 00:00:52.169
Inside, he saw some other ghosts, along with a crowd of goblins, zombies, and other monsters.

4
00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:54.911
Everyone was talking loudly.

5
00:00:54.931 --> 00:00:56.912
"Ben, over here!"

6
00:00:58.093 --> 00:01:00.794
Ben easily spotted the giant who was waving to him.

7
00:01:02.315 --> 00:01:03.476
Ben shot over to her.

8
00:01:05.204 --> 00:01:08.865
"I'm glad you're here, Gaby," said Ben as he sat down next to her.

9
00:01:08.885 --> 00:01:12.606
"You're the only one I know in—" Crash!

10
00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.107
Ben stopped talking.

11
00:01:15.547 --> 00:01:17.448
So did all the other monsters around him.

12
00:01:18.448 --> 00:01:20.849
A two-headed monster looked up at the ceiling.

13
00:01:20.869 --> 00:01:24.470
"What made that sound?"

14
00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.271
asked one of her heads.

15
00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:30.752
"I don't know," answered her other head.

16
00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:36.608
"It sounded like a giant landed on the roof of the school," said a goblin.

17
00:01:38.269 --> 00:01:42.392
"Maybe it's my mom," Gaby whispered to Ben with a giggle.

18
00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:44.174
Ben grinned.

19
00:01:45.275 --> 00:01:47.717
Gaby's mom was a giant, just like Gaby.

20
00:01:48.617 --> 00:01:51.540
But Ben was pretty sure she wasn't on the roof of the school.

21
00:01:53.741 --> 00:01:57.344
Mr. Freaky, the school principal, rushed onto the stage.

22
00:01:58.405 --> 00:02:01.468
He was tall and thin, and he had three noses.

23
00:02:08.896 --> 00:02:10.857
"Monsters, please be seated!

24
00:02:11.177 --> 00:02:13.419
Everything is totally under control!"

25
00:02:17.822 --> 00:02:21.884
Freaky loves to say that everything is under control," Gaby whispered.

26
00:02:21.904 --> 00:02:26.407
"But what he really means is that everything is totally out of control!"

27
00:02:27.607 --> 00:02:29.068
Ben laughed.

28
00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:34.712
It was lucky that his family had moved next door to Gaby over the summer.

29
00:02:35.808 --> 00:02:40.109
Gaby had told Ben nearly everything he needed to know about Monster Academy.

30
00:02:40.129 --> 00:02:45.851
"All the students and teachers are monsters, just like us," she had explained.

31
00:02:45.871 --> 00:02:49.932
"The principal is pretty nice—as long as you don't get in trouble.

32
00:02:51.152 --> 00:02:54.453
The office ogre is friendly too, unless she gets really busy.

33
00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:57.094
After all, she only has four arms!"

34
00:02:58.874 --> 00:03:01.235
Ben looked around the crowded auditorium again.

35
00:03:02.695 --> 00:03:04.396
Most of the students were still talking.

36
00:03:05.496 --> 00:03:08.679
A few ghosts in the last row were batting around a ball of paper.

37
00:03:13.463 --> 00:03:15.685
Mr. Freaky clapped his hands for silence.

38
00:03:15.705 --> 00:03:19.208
"Please don't worry about the loud crash.

39
00:03:19.528 --> 00:03:21.710
I'm sure it was just another broom."

40
00:03:23.532 --> 00:03:25.033
A murmur went through the crowd.

41
00:03:26.615 --> 00:03:27.375
"What is Mr.

42
00:03:27.435 --> 00:03:28.857
Freaky talking about?"

43
00:03:29.337 --> 00:03:30.058
asked a troll.

44
00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:41.063
"We've had a few incidents involving flying brooms this morning," Mr.

45
00:03:41.123 --> 00:03:41.944
Freaky went on.

46
00:03:41.964 --> 00:03:44.645
"But let's forget about that for now.

47
00:03:45.126 --> 00:03:49.468
Your eighth-grade class president, Waldo Wizz, would like to say a few words."

48
00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:56.953
Monsters whistled and shouted as a young wizard approached the microphone.

49
00:03:58.193 --> 00:03:59.334
Gaby's eyes lit up.

50
00:04:00.115 --> 00:04:02.416
"Waldo's amazing," she gushed.

51
00:04:03.444 --> 00:04:04.585
"He's so cute.

52
00:04:05.045 --> 00:04:08.408
Plus, he's super smart, and he can do all kinds of magic."

53
00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:12.692
Waldo waved to the crowd.

54
00:04:12.712 --> 00:04:17.756
"This is going to be a fabulous school year," he began.

55
00:04:17.776 --> 00:04:32.988
"We have two new after-school band and spell casting— and the first dance is coming up soon.

56
00:04:33.608 --> 00:04:36.069
The Monster Mash dance will be held in a few weeks.

57
00:04:36.309 --> 00:04:40.871
So don't forget to show your best school spirit and participate in all our great activities!"

58
00:04:42.112 --> 00:04:46.413
The crowd cheered again.

59
00:04:48.134 --> 00:04:50.055
Waldo handed the microphone to Mr.

60
00:04:50.095 --> 00:04:54.357
Freaky. "Settle down, students," said Mr.

61
00:04:54.417 --> 00:04:59.259
Freaky. "Before you go to class, I have some news about People Place.

62
00:04:59.719 --> 00:05:00.739
There's a new mayor."

63
00:05:05.196 --> 00:05:08.717
"People Place is creepy," murmured a skeleton.

64
00:05:10.317 --> 00:05:14.499
In the next row, a four-eyed monster leaned toward a three-eyed monster.

65
00:05:14.519 --> 00:05:18.460
"I heard the new mayor is really scary looking.

66
00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.580
He only has two eyes!"

67
00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.381
"Eww, gross!"

68
00:05:23.961 --> 00:05:25.642
replied the three-eyed monster.

69
00:05:26.422 --> 00:05:30.163
Ben knew that Monsterville was next to a town inhabited by people.

70
00:05:30.943 --> 00:05:33.444
A huge wooden fence separated the two towns.

71
00:05:35.252 --> 00:05:39.334
His parents had warned him and his brother, Sid, to stay away from that fence.

72
00:05:40.195 --> 00:05:42.216
But he didn't know anything about the mayor.

73
00:05:43.336 --> 00:05:44.997
Mr. Freaky was still talking.

74
00:05:45.017 --> 00:05:49.220
"I've been told that Mayor Hubbletree doesn't like monsters.

75
00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:52.341
So we must be extra careful not to upset him.

76
00:05:52.741 --> 00:05:56.984
Remember—Monster Academy was built on land owned by People Place.

77
00:05:58.204 --> 00:06:01.646
If we scare the people, they could force us to leave our school."

78
00:06:02.787 --> 00:06:04.708
The two-headed monster raised her hand.

79
00:06:05.964 --> 00:06:10.106
"I was near People Place last week," said one head.

80
00:06:10.126 --> 00:06:14.888
"A human kid saw me and screamed!"

81
00:06:14.908 --> 00:06:17.749
"I wasn't even doing anything!"

82
00:06:18.349 --> 00:06:19.290
said the other head.

83
00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.571
Mr. Freaky nodded.

84
00:06:21.591 --> 00:06:26.313
"Unfortunately, some people get scared just looking at monsters.

85
00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:31.095
Now, please exit quietly, monsters, and enjoy your first day of school.

86
00:06:31.575 --> 00:06:34.156
It's going to be a wonderful school year!"

87
00:06:35.192 --> 00:06:36.893
Ben and Gaby exchanged looks.

88
00:06:38.174 --> 00:06:41.435
"And everything is totally under total control!"

89
00:06:42.116 --> 00:06:44.117
they said at the same time, laughing.

90
00:06:47.079 --> 00:06:48.579
They headed out of the auditorium.

91
00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:55.163
Ben thought it was fun to kid around with Gaby, and so far Monster Academy seemed really cool.

92
00:06:56.163 --> 00:06:58.945
But he had to admit that a few things were worrying him.

93
00:07:00.005 --> 00:07:04.228
The principal seemed nervous, and empty brooms were crashing around the school.

94
00:07:05.196 --> 00:07:09.601
Plus, People Place had a new mayor—one who didn't like monsters!
